**trace.hpp defines the no-op controller profiling facade.**

## Interface

- `LIBIW4X_CONTROLLER_TRACE` defaults to `0`; `trace::enabled` is `inline constexpr bool`, true iff nonzero.
- `CONTROLLER_ZONE(name)` and `CONTROLLER_FRAME_MARK()` expand to `do {} while (false)`, preserving optional instrumentation call sites.

## Contracts

`CONTROLLER_ZONE` names pipeline stages and `CONTROLLER_FRAME_MARK` marks controller frames; both must remain optional and preserve per-frame acquisition behavior when tracing is disabled.